# Rebuild EXE After App Changes

After completing any code change that affects the running desktop app (Python UI, services, branding, assets, `main.py`, `*_ui.py`, etc.), rebuild `CinMuhasebe.exe` before finishing the task.

## Required steps

1. If `CinMuhasebe.exe` is running and locking the file, kill it first.
2. Rebuild with:
   `.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m PyInstaller --noconfirm CinMuhasebe.spec`
3. In the completion summary, mention the new EXE path: `dist\CinMuhasebe\CinMuhasebe.exe` (onedir; and size if useful).

## Exceptions — skip rebuild only when

- The user explicitly says not to rebuild the EXE, or
- The task was docs-only / git-only with no app code change

## Do not

- Commit `dist/` unless the user asks
- Skip the rebuild after UI/service/branding changes just because the Python script still runs
